{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"01f605d2e3a1256a67b9b5fc5027da1107c6f87c556bc4a4e0322aa23d84ed9a","ja":"千鶴直伝リース作り","zh":"千鹤亲授的花环制作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f19da245a2115b89f22b26a1eff506eadd22b067c2c8749b4f46840c4a52a9bd","ja":"ひと月前のある日の出来事……。","zh":"一个月前的某一天发生的事……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"61ebc66af4fc92ae039db2d7400d3b0315ec67aada6159a916239bb6badcb010","ja":"ワイヤーをクルクル～ってして……ウン！","zh":"把线咕噜咕噜地绕……嗯！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9e583d812311803fa92ec539eec87ab38079f456cac56e7da3dd61404504f0ef","ja":"チヅル、リースの土台できたヨ♪","zh":"千鹤，花环的底座做好了哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"096268cf6235873255b1a7c671b6bd9e845270f3096d81ba0b40da867d6a9351","ja":"よくできていますわね♪\nでは、次は飾り付けに入りましょう。","zh":"做得很好呢♪\n那么，接下来开始装饰吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"beea3cec841555241203a6e2161379885f46526d6e536106dfad6e9b7e7e84c8","ja":"リースって、色んな飾りがあるよネ。松ぼっくりとか、\nベリーみたいなのとか。どうしようかナ～。","zh":"花环上有各种各样的装饰呢。松果啦、\n像浆果一样的东西啦。该怎么办才好呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bb2bfc2bd02cbf07e5a86a477b1eb10ea2febc19f7ff56b926ff28ad319e3fd9","ja":"取り外しもできますし、どんな雰囲気にしたいか\n考えながら、進めていけばいいですわ♪","zh":"也可以拆下来，一边考虑想要什么样的氛围，\n推进下去就好了啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"fe5903c09d37b0ad955d05b5d920aad5ec0dc972f6b0bcc7a2425d62d3ae6d8c","ja":"そっか～！　それじゃあ、これとこれを使って……。","zh":"这样啊～！那么，就用这个和这个……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1218b98d21aeed2477642288fb4fcf5da8ca933853e70f966ed0df8e70f5dbb5","ja":"できた～！　見て見てチヅル～！\nワタシのリースどうかナ？","zh":"做好了～！快看快看，千鹤～！\n我的花环怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"338297b102f137b23dd96fc8babfd420b3842a9b861c7b34666d99447de21f33","ja":"ええ、素敵ですわ！　赤いベリーが散りばめられて、\nとってもかわいいですわよ♪","zh":"是的，真是太棒了！　点缀着红色的浆果，\n非常可爱呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d2b977cc7a9e9a545c1b04bcaee6192e9e45d0f31f61615ab21f63b10ba4266d","ja":"エヘヘ♪　チヅルのアドバイスのおかげだヨ！\nワタシ、みんなにも見せてこよ～っと♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪　多亏了千鹤的建议哦！\n我也去给大家看看吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"06761af4ce4460ed373a7da203dee52db547a694eb6e1d6d1a9fab00071c309f","ja":"私もできました。見てください。\n……力作です。","zh":"我也完成了。请看看。\n……是力作。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4267ba5369e174b20928c53048b364af3306e3f93fdcadb426c85e6f3e00deef","ja":"まぁ、瑞希のはとってもシックですわね。\n大人っぽいですわ。","zh":"嘛，瑞希的真的很时尚呢。\n很成熟呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9ea0818bea79fd40645070b05023ea4ed3e375a65c8de027e43b8c123752b6ac","ja":"ドライフラワーと松ぼっくりで、仕上げてみました。\n天然素材で攻めてみたぞ。","zh":"用干花和松果做了最后的点缀。试着用天然素材大胆挑战了一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"adf03e8eac2641081572a9ea63dcdf7cae60fb993143ddaa257f525b64d934de","ja":"なんかエレナのも瑞希のも、\n作った人の感性が感じられるリースですね♪","zh":"总觉得艾莲娜的和瑞希的，都能让人感受到制作者感性的花环呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c2b80ee85392518651224fa65599da9a1e850957ebaf7691fb22496a7aa002b2","ja":"あっ、ボクはパステルカラーいっぱいで\nキュートなリースにしてみたんですけど……。","zh":"啊，我用了满满的粉彩色调\n做成了一个可爱的花环……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"14b6fd56d57f535da047d3e67bb92dc7a0c9d21abe37d6e68f4aaa9911883a1b","ja":"ふふっ、それも真のかわいらしさが\n出ていて素敵ですわよ♪","zh":"呵呵，那份纯真的可爱也\n流露出来了，真棒呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3679550e8dc8a5394d67dcf6948201e77941661436f50e296ffc8a2c0747a5bd","ja":"へへっ、それならうれしいです！\nどこに飾ろうかな～……♪","zh":"嘿嘿，那样的话就太开心了！\n要装饰在哪里好呢～……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a3c122b2bcf0580dd7727027217c97f2e3139cb2a8ffd0a7402bc65b16496e5c","ja":"せっかくですし、●●●●プロデューサーに\n劇場に飾れないか聞いてみましょう。","zh":"机会难得，不如问问●●●●制作人\n能不能装饰在剧场里吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_967.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"976c3259fc5e2b0368bb41cbf952978bbc4da6cc4160ba626380fe926240842b","ja":"それはナイスアイデアです。みんなにも、\nクリスマス気分を味わってもらえたら嬉しいな。","zh":"那是个好主意。要是大家也能\n体验到圣诞节的气氛，我会很高兴。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
